# Chapter II, Melee: the player sleeps off the night in the stranger's room
# above the port and wakes to his warning letter. Sagrim half remembers the
# stranger, Werd says Gredarg wants the player, and Gredarg lies murdered in
# the alley while men in black search the port. Paul hides the player in his
# house and goes down to meet the soldiers; the player slips out the back,
# finds Paul dead, and is arrested and taken to the galleon.
# Position stands in for the walks through the port.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from melee_rest
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# The stranger sends the player to bed; the night brings a dream.
case melee_rest
talk ANFBoteHaus
bye
activate ANFBett01
sleep 8
until 600 Storyvar == 4
end

# The stranger is gone; his letter and a key lie on the table.
case melee_letter
activate MeleeBriefBote01
close Book Menu
expect GetJournalIndex A_II_Melee == 1
take Key_MeleePlayerHaus
until 120 player->GetItemCount Key_MeleePlayerHaus == 1
end

# Sagrim, below in the port, asks about the stranger at their table.
case melee_sagrim
run
player->Position -95803 401379 575 180
wait 120
ask stranger at our table
choose 2
choose 3
choose 4
choose 6
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_II_Melee == 2
end

# Werd: Gredarg is looking for the player.
case melee_werd
run
player->Position -99999 399504 629 180
wait 120
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_II_hafenfischer == 1
end

# Gredarg lies murdered in the alley.
case melee_gredarg
run
player->Position -99971 400872 702 180
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_II_hafenfischer == 2
expect Storyvar == 5
end

# Men in black search the port for the player.
case melee_soldiers
run
player->Position -101870 400375 815 180
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_II_hafenfischer == 3
end

# Paul hears what happened and takes the player home.
case melee_paul
run
player->Position -96550 404707 1252 0
wait 120
ask what's going on?
choose 1
choose 2
choose 3
choose 4
bye
until 120 Storyvar == 6
expect GetJournalIndex A_II_Paul == 1
end

# Over tea, Paul sees the men in black coming, gives the player his spare key
# and goes down to them.
case melee_tea
talk ANFPaul02
ask some tea
choose 1
choose 3
choose 4
choose 5
bye
until 120 Storyvar == 7
expect player->GetItemCount Key_MeleePaul == 1
end

# Out by Paul's back door.
case melee_backdoor
activate ANFMeleeTurPaul01
until 300 Storyvar == 8
expect GetJournalIndex A_II_Paul == 16
end

# Paul lies dead in the street.
case melee_paul_dead
run
player->Position -96880 404731 1274 180
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_II_Paul == 21
end

# The soldiers arrest the player and carry them off to the galleon. The
# greeting's prison-ship script moves the player, which closes the menu.
case melee_arrest
run
player->Position -97820 404819 1317 180
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_II_Galeone == 1
expect GetJournalIndex A_II_Galeone == 1
until 600 GetPCCell "Galleon, Cells" == 1
end
